Bundled provider components
---------------------------

The provider plugin sources that are declared for bundling under providers/ are
listed below. The machine-readable contract lives in providers/import-boundary.json
and the human-readable contract in docs/providers-layout-contract.md. Attribution is
registered here up front so an import cannot land without its licence and copyright
notice; the source trees themselves are imported by SPEC5-B (OpenCode) and SPEC5-C
(Qwen).

1) OpenCode Go CLIProxyAPI plugin  ->  providers/opencode-go
   Source repository: massiveits/opencode-go-cliproxyapi
   License: MIT
   Copyright (c) 2026 massiveits
   Synced as a git subtree from the named remote `opencode-upstream` (branch main).

2) Qwen Token Plan CLIProxyAPI plugin  ->  providers/qwen
   Source repository: williamxhero/qwen-cliproxyapi
   License: MIT
   Copyright (c) 2026 williamxhero
   Imported once as a plain directory (no upstream subtree). This component also
   bundles the bailian-quota quota CLI (cmd/bailian-quota) and itself adapts code
   from massiveits/opencode-go-cliproxyapi (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 massiveits);
   providers/qwen/NOTICE.md must be imported verbatim and kept in place.
